tps://gitcode.com/huang-wei-chen"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177583793,"discussion_id":"6494de60e44bf13e16cb409909ce4e5ab69d1303","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `InferShapeFlashAttentionScore` 函数在动态图场景下，当输入 layout 为 `BSH` 或 `SBH` 且 query/key/value 的 H 维度（第 2 维，`DIM_NUM_2`）值为 `-1`（表示动态维度）时，shape 推导逻辑未正确处理而导致输出 shape 计算异常的问题。新增了提前判断逻辑：若任一输入的 H 维度为 `-1`，则直接将输出 `attentionOutShape` 的对应维度设为 `-1` 并返回，跳过后续基于该维度的除法运算。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **动态 H 维度的 -1 值处理**：在 `attention/flash_attention_score/op_host/flash_attention_score_infershape.cpp` 的 `InferShapeFlashAttentionScore` 函数中，针对 `BSH`/`SBH` layout 分支新增判断：当 `queryShape`、`keyShape` 或 `valueShape` 中任一第 2 维为 `-1` 时，将 `attentionOutShape` 的第 2 维也设为 `-1` 并立即返回 `GRAPH_SUCCESS`，防止后续 `h1 / N1` 等除法运算因动态维度而产生错误结果。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-29T10:18:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-29T10:18:45+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177583878,"discussion_id":"e99d11033a9c05c7215656d57ced5403fc2eaa5a","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=6138578a57a544c89ec79643d056df7d&projectName=CANN'>6138578a57a544c89ec79643d056df7d</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=6138578a57a544c89ec79643d056df